 * - isActive: Enable/disable provider
 *
 * Response Codes:
 * - 200 OK: Provider updated successfully
 * - 400 Bad Request: Invalid JSON body
 * - 401 Unauthorized: Authentication required
 * - 404 Not Found: Provider with ID does not exist
